1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:02,333
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:03,267
Uh...

3
00:00:05,067 --> 00:00:07,600
I'm sorry, I'm...

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,700
a bit tipsy.

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,000
I think I'll see you
tomorrow in the hotel.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,433
Are you sure you're okay?

7
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:18,167
Okay.

8
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:19,533
Uh...

9
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:20,700
Bye.

10
00:00:24,267 --> 00:00:25,600
Thank you.

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,300
[DOOR OPENS]

12
00:00:29,567 --> 00:00:30,767
Take care.

13
00:00:30,767 --> 00:00:36,100
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

14
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,400
Because I care.

15
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,733
[DOOR CLOSES]

16
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:46,667
- [SQUEALS]
- [PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

17
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:48,600
Oh my god. Yes!

18
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,233
Yes! Yes!

19
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:52,000
[SQUEALS]

20
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:56,300
[GIGGLING]

21
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:58,033
Yes! Yes!

22
00:00:58,033 --> 00:01:01,067
[SMOOCHES, GIGGLES]

23
00:01:01,067 --> 00:01:04,433
- [EXHALES SOFTLY, SQUEALS]
- [KNOCKING ON DOOR]

24
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,633
[KNOCKING CONTINUES]

25
00:01:06,633 --> 00:01:10,400
Gosh. He misses me already?

26
00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:12,800
Isn't it too soon? [GIGGLES]

27
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,667
- [KNOCKING CONTINUES]
- [DOOR OPENS]

28
00:01:15,667 --> 00:01:19,467
[GRIM MUSIC PLAYING]

29
00:01:19,467 --> 00:01:20,767
M-Madam...

30
00:01:20,767 --> 00:01:27,367
[GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

31
00:01:28,467 --> 00:01:30,233
I won't take long.

32
00:01:30,233 --> 00:01:32,400
I know you only want this.

33
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:37,300
[GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

34
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,400
Stop pestering my husband!

35
00:01:40,667 --> 00:01:42,767
I don't want to see you again.

36
00:01:43,733 --> 00:01:44,800
[HUFFS]

37
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:51,667
[GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

38
00:02:05,467 --> 00:02:11,433
[GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]
